ol.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/caci-international-caci-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2019 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Mengucci","x":"So it wasn't cost savings for the sake of cost savings but cost savings to allow us to make -- reposition the money to make other better use of those funds kind of within the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/caci-international-caci-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2019 Q4","e":"caci","d":"2019-08-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Mutryn","x":"As a background, in 2017, we undertook an internal reorganization to streamline our structure, transferring several thousand employees from various subsidiaries of CACI -- from various subsidiaries to CACI Inc-Federal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/16/caci-international-caci-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q1","e":"caci","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tom Mutryn","x":"Organic growth in the quarter was a bit higher than expected, driven by around $20 million of low-margin pass-through material purchases, which occurred earlier than anticipated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/caci-international-caci-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q1","e":"caci","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Sheila Kahyaoglu","x":"The pass-through business is maybe 20 bps of an impact in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/caci-international-caci-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q1","e":"caci","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"John Mengucci","x":"As a result of these acquisitions, we are raising our guidance for fiscal-year 2020, which Tom will discuss in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/caci-international-caci-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q1","e":"caci","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Mutryn","x":"Cumulatively, we expect them to add around $50 million to our fiscal '20 revenue and $3 million to net income, and we have increased our guidance accordingly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/caci-international-caci-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q2","e":"caci","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Mengucci","x":"On the enterprise side, every time we move social funding and different programs around both the Fed, civil, and the defense side are always looking to modernize and updating their systems and making more technological infrastructure estimates, and that really drives long-term cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/caci-international-caci-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2020-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Mutryn","x":"Turning to our outlook, we are pleased to reiterate the guidance we provided last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/caci-international-caci-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2020 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2020-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Mutryn","x":"And we are pleased to be able to reiterate our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/caci-international-caci-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q2","e":"caci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"John S. Mengucci","x":"The government fiscal year '21 budget includes increased funding for the Defense Health program, which will benefit our work fielding HALO, or our Health Assessment Lite Operations, in theater medical record systems.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/caci-international-inc-caci-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q2","e":"caci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Mutryn","x":"And so, we're maintaining the guidance that we spoke about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/caci-international-inc-caci-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q2","e":"caci","d":"2021-01-28","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Gavin Parsons","x":"So, would you say you've absorbed the potentially higher headwind within the reiterated guidance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/caci-international-inc-caci-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2021-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Mengucci","x":"Second, in area of investment, I discussed a few quarters ago, was artificial intelligence or AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/caci-international-inc-caci-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2021-04-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Mengucci","x":"It wasn't, but 10 years ago where we were talking about how much work we were doing on S3 and how much pass-through war-related work we had.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/caci-international-inc-caci-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Mengucci","x":"That was somewhere between $20 million to $30 million cost savings annually for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/caci-international-inc-caci-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"CACI 2021 Q3","e":"caci","d":"2021-04-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Tom Mutryn","x":"On the net income side, we are raising guidance materially to reflect strong program performance, lower cost delivery on the fixed price program we've previously discussed, lower indirect expenses, higher than expected R&D tax credits and the large fourth quarter tax benefit I detailed already.","url":"https